    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "2.3.13【数形结合法之圆】"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.119,
      0.248,
      0.134
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "▲适用题型：",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.147,
      0.147,
      0.467,
      0.171
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "常见于含有 \\(\\sqrt{r^2 - (x - a)^2} + b\\) 结构的题型；",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.184,
      0.248,
      0.198
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "▲方法原理：",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.149,
      0.212,
      0.731,
      0.255
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "令 \\( y=\\sqrt{r^{2}-\\left(x-a\\right)^{2}}\\Rightarrow y=\\sqrt{r^{2}-\\left(x-a\\right)^{2}}\\geq0\\Rightarrow\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y\\geq0\\\\ \\left(x-a\\right)^{2}+y^{2}=r^{2}\\end{aligned}\\right. \\) 即得到半圆，",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.146,
      0.269,
      0.728,
      0.309
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "1. 若是分式类型，常将问题转换为斜率问题，比如 \\( f(x) = \\frac{\\sqrt{4 - (x - 3)^2} - 2}{x + 2} \\)，",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.149,
      0.321,
      0.695,
      0.368
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "(1) 令 \\( y = \\sqrt{4 - (x - 3)^2} \\Rightarrow y = \\sqrt{4 - (x - 3)^2} \\geq 0 \\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} y \\geq 0 \\\\ (x - 3)^2 + y^2 = 4 \\end{cases} \\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.149,
      0.377,
      0.841,
      0.533
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "(2) \\(\\Rightarrow \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} f(x) = \\frac{\\sqrt{4 - (x - 3)^2} - 2}{x + 2} = \\frac{y - 2}{x - (-2)} \\\\ k_{AB} = \\frac{y_A - y_B}{x_A - x_B} \\end{array} \\right\\} \\Rightarrow f(x) = k_{AB}\\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.147,
      0.545,
      0.434,
      0.56
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "最后作图分析求出 AB 斜率范围即可；",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.146,
      0.575,
      0.816,
      0.595
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "2. 若是整式类型，常将问题转换两函数图像问题，比如 \\( f(x) = 3x - 1 - \\sqrt{-x^2 + 4x - 3} \\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.149,
      0.606,
      0.554,
      0.66
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "(1) \\( \\left\\{\\begin{aligned}f(x)=3x-1-\\sqrt{-x^{2}+4x-3}&=3x-1-\\sqrt{1-\\left(x-2\\right)^{2}},\\\\ \\text{令}t=f(x)\\Rightarrow\\sqrt{1-\\left(x-2\\right)^{2}}=3x-1-t\\end{aligned}\\right. \\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.15,
      0.664,
      0.5,
      0.728
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "(2) \\( \\left\\{\\begin{aligned} 令 y_{1}&= \\sqrt{1-(x-2)^{2}}\\geq0\\Rightarrow\\left\\{\\begin{aligned} y\\geq0\\\\ (x-2)^{2}+y^{2}&=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\\\\ 令 y_{2}&=3x-1-t, 则 y_{1}=y_{2}\\end{aligned}\\right. \\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.149,
      0.731,
      0.43,
      0.748
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "\\(\\Rightarrow y_{1}\\) 和 \\(y_{2}\\) 有交点时，求纵截距- \\(t\\) 范围",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "image",
    "bbox": [
      0.55,
      0.603,
      0.818,
      0.752
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": null
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.147,
      0.758,
      0.537,
      0.774
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "最后作图分析即可求出-t范围，也就求出t范围；",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.146,
      0.78,
      0.677,
      0.816
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "例题1.（全国·高三专题练习）函数 \\( y = \\frac{\\sqrt{1 - x^2}}{x + 2} \\) 的值域是____.",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "page_number",
    "bbox": [
      0.49,
      0.929,
      0.507,
      0.939
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "96"
  }
]
